{"title": "Necrotic Claws (Shadow)", "pageid": 31136, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Necrotic_Claws_(Shadow)", "categories": ["Class actions", "Actions", "Sources of Slashing damage", "Sources of Necrotic damage"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Physical.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ed/Generic_Physical.webp/300px-Generic_Physical.webp, /w/images/e/ed/Generic_Physical.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ed/Generic_Physical.webp/300px-Generic_Physical.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ed/Generic_Physical.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>This action is the basic melee attack for <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow\" title=\"Shadow\">Shadows</a>.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nLash out with cursed claws.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a></dd><dt>Damage: 4~24 + modifiers</dt><dd class=\"bg3wiki-damage-display\" style=\"margin-left:0px\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;width:fit-content\"><span style=\"display:block;position:relative;width:42px;height:30px;margin-left:0px;padding-top:9px;margin-right:2px\"><span style=\"z-index:1;position:absolute;transform:translate( 0%, 0%)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/D8_Physical.png/26px-D8_Physical.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/D8_Physical.png/40px-D8_Physical.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/D8_Physical.png/53px-D8_Physical.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/D8_Physical.png/26px-D8_Physical.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"26\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/8a/D8_Physical.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><span style=\"z-index:0;position:absolute;transform:translate( 40%, -30%) rotate(20deg)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5c/D4_Necrotic.png/31px-D4_Necrotic.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5c/D4_Necrotic.png/46px-D4_Necrotic.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5c/D4_Necrotic.png/62px-D4_Necrotic.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5c/D4_Necrotic.png/31px-D4_Necrotic.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"31\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5c/D4_Necrotic.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><div><div style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-slashing\">2d8 + <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity#Dexterity_modifier_chart\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity modifier</a></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Slashing\" title=\"Slashing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Slashing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Slashing\" title=\"Slashing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-slashing\">Slashing</span></a></div><div style=\"white-space:nowrap\"> + <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">2d4</span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a></div></div></div></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_I